# Backend Architecture (FastAPI)

Scribely backend is a FastAPI app that receives meeting uploads from the desktop app, runs diarization/speaker identification, and exposes APIs for chat, auth, and metrics.

## File Organization

```
backend/
├── app/
│   ├── main.py              # FastAPI app entry, lifespan, middleware
│   ├── config.py            # Pydantic Settings (env vars)
│   ├── exceptions.py        # Custom exceptions + handlers
│   ├── api/
│   │   ├── deps.py          # FastAPI dependencies (auth, db session)
│   │   ├── response_wrapper.py
│   │   └── v1/              # Versioned API routes
│   │       ├── router.py     # Aggregates all v1 routers
│   │       ├── auth.py       # Clerk JWT verification
│   │       ├── chat.py       # Chat endpoints
│   │       ├── health.py     # Health checks
│   │       ├── meetings.py   # Meeting sync, upload, processing status
│   │       └── metrics.py    # Metrics/monitoring
│   ├── agents/              # LLM agents (LangChain + OpenRouter)
│   │   ├── base.py          # BaseAgent, SimpleAgent
│   │   ├── registry.py      # AgentRegistry
│   │   ├── agents/<name>.py  # Agent implementations
│   │   ├── prompt/<name>.py  # SYSTEM_PROMPT strings
│   │   ├── structured_output/<name>.py  # Pydantic response models
│   │   └── tool/<name>.py    # @tool functions
│   ├── database/
│   │   ├── base.py          # SQLAlchemy Base
│   │   ├── session.py       # Async session, get_async_session
│   │   ├── models/          # SQLAlchemy models (User, etc.)
│   │   └── repositories/    # Data access layer
│   ├── services/            # Business logic / pipeline orchestration
│   │   ├── meeting_processor.py  # Orchestrates: audio → diarize → frames → speaker ID
│   │   ├── speaker_identifier.py # Thin wrapper around SpeakerIdentifierAgent
│   │   └── task_runner.py        # Async background task scheduling
│   ├── infrastructure/      # External integrations
│   │   ├── llm_provider.py   # OpenRouterProvider
│   │   ├── langfuse_handler.py
│   │   ├── circuit_breaker.py
│   │   ├── diarization/      # Speaker diarization (base + providers)
│   │   │   ├── base.py       # BaseDiarizer ABC
